Maybe the file name includes "NaSiO" etc. Let's list all files recursively under /potentials.
{
  "path": "/potentials",
  "recursive": true
}

It only lists directories, not files inside. The list_files tool maybe doesn't list files inside subdirectories unless we specify path to subdirectory. We saw BKS contains pot.mod. Maybe other directories contain files. Let's list inside EAM.
{
  "path": "/potentials/EAM",
  "recursive": false
}
